														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1447341">
									

<p>I'm kind of confused, but I still like this so up-voted.</p>
<p>First, wouldn't the door to a room with some kind of monster-thing in it be airtight and thus impossible to slip a note under, and which SCP is this?</p>
<p>The real 142 is just a somewhat OTT one-armed bandit not an assimilating monster.</p>
<p>All in all, good tale if a bit confusing.</p>

