			<div class="content" id="post-content-1447346">
									

<p>1) I don't see why, provided there's no gap large enough for the entity to escape or otherwise manipulate the door. Airtight rooms have their own problems and are rather expensive. No need to use those resources when they're not necessary.</p>
<p>2) It's not any extant SCP. That's why it's blacked out. 142 is just the number of the cell; presumably it's the one hundred forty-second cell on that particular site.</p>

